/T (SkyDrop AI is an innovative urban logistics layer designed to transform last-mile delivery through autonomous drone technology and artificial intelligence. The system integrates AI-enabled route planning, autonomous drone operations, weather-resilient payload handling, and smart micro-hub infrastructure to deliver essential goods faster, safer, and more efficiently than conventional road-based transportation.)
/E (SkyDrop AI is an innovative urban logistics layer designed to transform last-mile delivery through autonomous drone technology and artificial intelligence. The system integrates AI-enabled route planning, autonomous drone operations, weather-resilient payload handling, and smart micro-hub infrastructure to deliver essential goods faster, safer, and more efficiently than conventional road-based transportation.)
